cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use AEGIS in your research, please cite the journal article listed
  under preferred-citation.
type: software
title: "AEGIS: Annotation Extraction and Genomic Integration Suite"
abstract: >-
  A toolkit to parse, correct and standardise genome annotations (GFF3/GTF),
  extract features (e.g. coding sequences, promoters) and perform comparative
  genomic analyses, including gene model correspondence and orthology
  inference.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-03
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: https://github.com/Tomsbiolab/aegis
url: https://github.com/Tomsbiolab/aegis
keywords:
  - genome annotation
  - GFF3
  - GTF
  - orthology
  - bioinformatics
